# Security headers for every page Cloudflare Pages serves (see CLAUDE.md).
# - HSTS: browsers always use HTTPS for textthem.app (subdomains left out on
#   purpose, since Clerk's and the mail records live there).
# - Frame protection: no other site may embed these pages (clickjacking).
# - Permissions-Policy: the site uses no camera, microphone, location, etc.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
